## Pin: B1+B3 — `Mutex.new(7)` reports `Mutex[Int]`, and the chained
## `m.lock_raw.get` reports `Int`. If subst_ty regresses or the
## lib decl loses its structured return type, this stops typechecking
## with "no field `get` on type `Int`" or "no field `to_s` on type `T`".
def main
  let m = Mutex.new(7)
  let g = m.lock_raw
  let v = g.get
  let _doubled = v + 1
end
